      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etu aPawulu naSilasi niTimotewu, tudi nakuyisonekela mukanda, enu akwachipompelu chakuTesalonika chekala mudi Nzambi Tata, niMwanta Yesu Kristu. Luwi lwikali nanenu nikuwunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twayisakililaŋa wejima wenu kudi Nzambi mafuku ejima, nakuyitena mukulomba kwetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twenda twanuka mudimu wenu wakukuhwelela kumesu aNzambi, yowu Tata yetu, ni kukabakana kwenu kwakukepa, nikutatakena kwenu kwenzaŋa kukuchiŋeja kwekala mudi Mwanta wetu Yesu Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwetu ayikeŋa kudi Nzambi, tuneluki kutonda kwayitondeluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashikili kudenu nsaŋu yayiwahi yitwashimwinetu, hiyadiŋi yamazu tuhuku, ilaŋa yadiŋi nimuŊovu nawa, nimudi Spiritu Wajila, nimwalumbuluka chikupu. Muloŋa muneluki chitwashakamini mukachi kenu chitwadiŋi nenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninenu mwelili akwakutwimbujola etu niMwanta, chimwatambwili mazu mulukadi lwalweni, namuzaŋalu waSpiritu Wajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himukwikala antu akutalilahu akwakwitiya amuMasidoniya nimuAkaya ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa enu mwatiyakesheli mazu aMwanta, bayi muMasidoniya naAkaya hohuku, iloŋa kukuhwelela kwenu kumwamukuhwelela Nzambi kunatiyakani kwejima; ochu chi kweti etu kuhoshamu wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋawenawu ashimunaŋa nichitwashikili kudenu, nichimwabalumukili nakutala kudi Nzambi nakuleka akishi, kulonda mukaiakeli Nzambi wamumi walala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mutalilaŋa Mwanindi asaŋwiliyi mudi afu, wakafuma mwiwulu, diyi Yesu watupulwishaŋa kukuzuwa kwamba kenza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
